    <us-gaap:SubsequentEventsTextBlock contextRef="c-1" id="f-1467">Subsequent Events&lt;div style="margin-top:7pt;text-indent:22.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;On November&#160;24, 2025, the Board of Directors of the Company declared a cash dividend of $0.99 per outstanding share of common stock. The dividend will be paid on December&#160;22, 2025 to all shareholders of record at the close of business on December&#160;8, 2025 and is expected to total approximately $484.8 million.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</us-gaap:SubsequentEventsTextBlock>
